# RUN: python3 %S/../../../../../../tools/check/named-callees.py --translate ctjs-translate --opt ctjs-opt --corpus %S/../../../../../../ctbrowser/vendor/bootstrap/bootstrap.bundle.js --require-entry-callee 'fn$2' --require-entry-callee 'fn$1' --require-entry-callee 'bi$88' --require-entry-callee 'fn$125' --require-entry-callee 'fn$126' --require-entry-callee 'fn$136' --expect-unreachable 'fn$178' --expect-unreachable 'fn$463' | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=BOOTSTRAP
# RUN: not python3 %S/../../../../../../tools/check/named-callees.py --translate ctjs-translate --opt ctjs-opt --corpus %S/../../../../../../ctbrowser/vendor/bootstrap/bootstrap.bundle.js --require-entry-callee 'fn$463' 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=UNREACHABLE
# RUN: python3 %S/../../../../../../tools/check/named-callees.py --translate ctjs-translate --opt ctjs-opt --corpus %S/../../../Fixtures/Closures/callback.js --require-entry-callee 'bootstrapFactory$9' | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=NATIVE

# Thirteen of the lifted callees capture only bindings of the run-once factory,
# which are static variables, so they are lifted with no captures.
# BOOTSTRAP: CLAIMED 0   LIFTED 18   REFUSED 19
# The frontend's cell-before-closure order exposes D$8 -> fn$9, outside startup.
# The absent-global fold leaves one call of the factory fn$2 (the CommonJS arm
# is gone), and closures over static variables add fn$66 and fn$544 as targets.
# Function declarations of the factory whose captures became static are bound
# as local functions, so their calls are direct: 14 more targets, 38 more calls.
# Calls of methods of the factory's object tables are direct too (Data's set,
# get and remove; EventHandler's on, one, off and trigger): 7 more targets,
# 103 more calls. SelectorEngine's and Manipulator's methods follow (one
# calls another through `this`, one creates a filter arrow): 13 more targets,
# 63 more calls.
# Flattening copies each component's inherited methods and statics onto it
# and erases the parents nothing reaches, and the static-member rewrite calls
# static members directly.
# The counts pinned before, 100 targets over 431 calls with 8 functions on
# the startup path, were measured on lane branches and never held on the
# integration branch: the first queue commit that carried them measured 127
# targets over 661 calls with 17 functions. Measured at each queue merge
# since, the counts moved by lane:
# - inheritance flattening: copies 4 more calls, arrow-this constructors 26
#   more, erasing child-only parents 19 fewer;
# - run-once singletons: statics read through a constructor 16 fewer targets
#   and calls, constructor narrowing 13 more targets and 14 more calls, and
#   static getters kept native for refused callers 11 fewer of each;
# - handlers: sibling trials and relayed captures 1 more target, 2 more calls;
# - static roots: binding a static that holds one function 1 more of each;
# - run-once singletons again: folding window reads and registries 69 more
#   targets, 87 more calls and the first 22 calls between native functions.
# BOOTSTRAP: post-native graph: 184 distinct targets over 749 ctjs.call_direct and 22 emitc.call site(s)
# The factory itself calls EventHandler's `on` (fn$136), now a direct call.
# One of those arrows, fn$126, is called from the startup path itself. Seven
# of the eight functions the old pin listed are still on the path, which the
# --require-entry-callee options above check whatever the full list becomes.
# The eighth, fn$178, left it with the window fold: nothing calls it directly
# any more, and it is only passed as a value, which --expect-unreachable
# pins. The integration adds D$8, L$5, N$17, S$7, fn$9, fn$11, fn$13, k$4 and
# x$3, and the window fold fn$447 and fifteen functions numbered fn$810 to
# fn$854.
# BOOTSTRAP: entry _script_$0: 32 function(s) on static direct-call paths
# BOOTSTRAP: reachable: D$8, L$5, N$17, S$7, _script_$0, bi$88, fn$1, fn$11, fn$125, fn$126, fn$13, fn$136, fn$2, fn$447, fn$810, fn$813, fn$815, fn$818, fn$821, fn$829, fn$832, fn$834, fn$837, fn$839, fn$842, fn$845, fn$848, fn$851, fn$854, fn$9, k$4, x$3
# UNREACHABLE: named-callees: fn$463 is not reachable by direct calls from _script_$0
# NATIVE: entry main:
